strengths.value:
1: The combination of event camera with 3D-GS is interesting and enable the leverage of efficient rendering capability of 3D-GS;

2: The experimental results, which conduct on both real and synthetic datasets, demonstrate the proposed method performs better than baseline methods, in terms of visual quality;

3: Additional experiments which integrate the proposed method with motion blurred RGB images, as well as for color reconstruction, are presented; The experiments demonstrate its advantage for more practical applications.

